    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just a weirdly comforting way to think about it, i guess. Like, if the most efficient thing to do is to let the equilibrium happen, then why does everyone act like fighting it is the only way to live? It feels like we're all just being forced to struggle against physics.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
